 :proposed-contract {:input "A closed synthetic request with exactly one explicit non-secret fixture string and an independently supplied exact trusted development source-binding record; not a profile, path, actual environment, policy or executable. Fail on missing/extra fields, NUL, invalid Unicode or values above the explicitly selected and tested UTF-8 byte bound; do not claim the bound is a Services-wide maximum."
                     :output "Canonical UTF-8 EDN bytes for exactly {:fixture/value <quoted-string>} plus one LF and an inert closed descriptor value equivalent to JSON fields schema=services.inert-edn/v1 and value=<same string>. Descriptor serialization for Services JSON is deferred to later reviewed boundary; never call the existing EDN descriptor itself Services wire JSON."
                     :subset "Admit only canonical byte form emitted by the pure renderer, using shared S1A safe canonical encoding where compatible. Require exactly one final LF, no BOM, no trailing or alternate whitespace, tags, extra forms or slash escape. Reject invalid/unpaired surrogates and NUL; include control escapes and non-BMP positive/negative goldens tested in both runtimes. The stronger canonical restriction is consumer law, not a claim that Services rejects all equivalent noncanonical input."
                     :pin "Use a separately supplied immutable allowlisted binding, never a renderer/request-selected policy: exact Services enclosing artifact commit/tree, runtime commit, validator source SHA-256, wire source SHA-256, descriptor hash and Oikos adapter/validator version/revision. Missing, altered, unrecognized or substituted binding fails closed; record that static identity comparisons do not verify file contents or authenticate a caller. Actual bytes and interpreter must be independently checked by the later trusted owner boundary. Pin evidence must distinguish d4f6ff artifact from b297 runtime and Oikos profile-edn-v1 from Services inert-edn-v1."
                     :errors "Closed sanitized fixed-code errors, no input/value echo; no fallback to profile renderer, bash, host environment, network or process. No approval, authority or effect inferred from success."}
 :red-oracles [{:id :r01 :test "Before source exists, shared BB and NBB test requires synthetic value lambda to yield exact UTF-8 {:fixture/value \"lambda\"} plus LF and closed descriptor schema/value; verify exact bytes and digest in both runtimes."}
